x725 text "fn sqstep u32 u32 -> u32\ns mul p1 p1\nr add p0 s\nret r\nend\nfn sumsq -> u32\nr fold sqstep 10 0\nret r\nend"
x726 puts x724 x725
x727 call close x726 
